         resolved to "$APPLE_TEAM_ID.tech.dongdongbh.mindwtr" and the app
         re-signed by scripts/build-macos-widget.sh (App Store mode), which
         runs after `tauri build`'s own first signature. When the App Store
         build ships without the widget (no MAS_WIDGET_PROVISIONING_PROFILE
         secret) release-macos-appstore.yml strips this key before the build,
         so no placeholder ever reaches App Store Connect. -->
    <key>com.apple.security.application-groups</key>
